meta {
  name: Raise Ticket
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/method/implementor.client_api.create_ticket
  body: formUrlEncoded
  auth: inherit
}

body:form-urlencoded {
  subject: System Log Information Not Working
  description: Some Bug when System Log Information Not Working
  ticket_type: bug
  priority: low
  project: PROJ-0029
  module: Accounting
  reference:
  ~server: s6qivo97hn
  ~customer: Hamza
}

tests {
  test("returns 200", function () {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
  });

  test("has message", function () {
    expect(res.body).to.have.property("message");
  });

  test("module is saved on its own field", function () {
    expect(res.body.message.module).to.equal("Accounting");
  });

  test("new ticket comes back as status new with codes", function () {
    expect(res.body.message.status).to.equal("new");
    expect(res.body.message.ticket_type).to.equal("bug");
    expect(res.body.message.priority).to.equal("low");
  });
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  Creates a support ticket.

  **Endpoint:** `POST /api/method/implementor.client_api.create_ticket`
  **Screen:** Raise Ticket

  > ⚠️ **Changes data** on the shared server. Use test records only.

  **Permission:** Signed-in client user (Client User or Client Admin). Only records of the user's own client company are returned.

  **Body fields (form-encoded):**

  | Field | Type | Required | Example | Notes |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `subject` | string | yes | `System Log Information Not Working` | Trimmed and cut to 140 characters. |
  | `description` | string | no | `...` | Defaults to empty. |
  | `ticket_type` | string | no | `bug` | A `value` from **Raise Ticket Form**: `bug`, `support`, `feature_request`, `training_request`, `question`. Default `support`. The desk label (e.g. `Bug`) is still accepted for older builds. |
  | `priority` | string | no | `low` | A `value` from **Raise Ticket Form**: `emergency`, `urgent`, `normal`, `low`. Default `normal`. The label is still accepted. |
  | `project` | string | no | `PROJ-0029` | A `name` from **Raise Ticket Form** `projects`. The project manager is notified. |
  | `module` | string | no | `Accounting` | Saved on the ticket and returned as `module`. Also written into the description as `Module: …` for older app builds. |
  | `reference` | string | no |  | Screen or document. Written into the description as `Screen or document: …`. |
  | `server` | string | no | `s6qivo97hn` | A server `name` from Servers, when the ticket is about a hosted server. Must be one of the client's servers. Returned as `server` / `server_name`. Disabled by default. |
  | `customer` | string | no | `Hamza` | Not used by the app. The server picks the user's company. Disabled by default. |

  **Response (trimmed):**

  The new ticket, in the same shape as **Ticket status**.

  ```json
  {
    "message": {
      "name": "12hnuea73s",
      "subject": "System Log Information Not Working",
      "description": "Module: Accounting\n\nSome Bug when System Log Information Not Working",
      "module": "Accounting",
      "server": null,
      "server_name": null,
      "ticket_type": "bug",
      "priority": "low",
      "status": "new",
      "needs_confirmation": false,
      ...
    }
  }
  ```

  **Errors:**

  - **401** (no error_code): token expired or invalid. Refresh once and retry, else sign out.
  - **403** (no error_code): no Authorization header sent.
  - **403 `no_client_linked`:** the signed-in user is not linked to any client company.
  - **403 `not_permitted`:** `project` or `server` is unknown or belongs to another client, or `customer` was sent for a company the user is not linked to.
  - **404 `not_found`:** `customer` was sent and does not exist.
  - **417 `missing_parameter`:** `subject` missing or blank.
  - **417 `invalid_ticket_type`:** `ticket_type` is not one of the form options.
  - **417 `invalid_priority`:** `priority` is not one of the form options.

  **Notes:**

  - Create the ticket first, then upload each file with **Attach** using the returned `name`. Confirm only after uploads finish.
}
